                                "sense_id": "dd818841-1433-3a7c-abf8-ffaaebda211a",
                                "text": "The steelmakers also entered into a national security agreement with the US government, the statement said. […] But US Steel has declined sharply since its heyday. It is no longer even the largest US steelmaker, with only 14,000 US employees — 11,000 of whom are USW members."
                            },
