                                "sense_id": "dd818841-1433-3a7c-abf8-ffaaebda211a",
                                "text": "Nippon Steel has finalized its deal to buy 100% of US Steel, the iconic steelmaker that was once the world’s most valuable company and a cornerstone of American industrial might."
